@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

title BuildRuleIndex on Application Startup\nAppStart → DB → In-Memory Cache

actor "ApplicationStartup\n(Service Boot)" as AppStart
participant "PromotionRuleController\n(infrastructure/adapter/in/web)" as Controller
participant "PromotionRuleService\n(application/service)" as RuleService
participant "PromotionRuleIndexDomainService\n(domain/service)" as RuleIndexDomainService
participant "PromotionRuleDomainService\n(domain/service)" as RuleDomainService
participant "RuleCache (In-Memory)\n(infrastructure/cache)" as Cache
participant "PromotionRuleRepository\n(infrastructure/adapter/out/persistence)" as Repository

AppStart -> Controller: preparePromotionRuleData()
activate Controller

Controller -> RuleService: buildPromotionRuleData()
activate RuleService

RuleService -> Repository: findActivePromotionRules()
activate Repository

Repository -> Repository: SELECT active rules\nFROM promotion_rules
note right of Repository
Also loads conditions/actions if joined\nor via secondary queries
end note

Repository --> RuleService: List<PromotionRuleEntity>
deactivate Repository

RuleService -> RuleIndexDomainService: generateRuleIndex(activeRules, conditions)
activate RuleIndexDomainService

RuleIndexDomainService -> RuleIndexDomainService: extractRuleIndex()
note right of RuleIndexDomainService
source: ~/epic.md -- **Sample Records → `promotion_condition`**
Constructs in-memory maps:
product:
  "P-1001" → [1,5]
  "P-1002" → [3]
category:
  "C-2001" → [2,7]
segment:
  FIRST_ORDER → [8]
  LOYALTY → [11]
payment:
  VISA → [4]
  COD → [6]
global:
  "TOTAL_BILL" → [15, 20]
end note

RuleIndexDomainService --> RuleService: ruleIndex (HashMaps)
deactivate RuleIndexDomainService

RuleService -> Cache: saveRuleIndex(ruleIndex)
activate Cache
note right of Cache
Store into local in-memory:
  ruleIndex.productRuleMap
  ruleIndex.categoryRuleMap
  ruleIndex.segmentRuleMap
  ruleIndex.paymentRuleMap
  ruleIndex.globalRuleMap

Available for Evaluate() instantly
end note

Cache --> RuleService
deactivate Cache

RuleService -> RuleDomainService: buildEvaluateRules(activeRules, conditions, actions)
activate RuleDomainService

loop for each activeRule in activeRules
    RuleDomainService -> RuleDomainService: transformToEvaluateRule(activeRule, conditions, actions)
    note right of RuleDomainService
    source: ~/epic.md
    - **In-Memory Rule Detail Structure for Evaluation Engine**
        - ConditionType including QUANTITY, AMOUNT, TOTAL_BILL, PRODUCT, CATEGORY,
          PAYMENT_METHOD, CUSTOMER_SEGMENT, FIRST_ORDER, CHANNEL, BRAND, SHIPPING_METHOD
    end note
end

RuleService <-- RuleDomainService: Map<ruleId, EvaluatePromotionRule>
deactivate RuleDomainService

RuleService -> Cache: saveEvaluateRules(evaluateRules)
activate Cache
note right of Cache
   Store into local in-memory
end note

RuleService <-- Cache

Controller <-- RuleService
deactivate RuleService

Controller --> AppStart: RuleIndex Ready (200 OK)
deactivate Controller

@enduml
